+-- The Coreforged gloves (the Coreforged set's gloves): black basalt bracers
+-- flaring to a wide cuff with a gold rim, a bold ember seam down the outside
+-- of each forearm, and plated hands with a gold knuckle ridge. The gold at
+-- cuff and knuckles reads from the high camera above the black arm, and the
+-- seam is the set's warm line down each side.
